><?= icon('shield',15) ?></span><a href="<?= e(route_url('/admin/audit')) ?>">Keep an eye on privileged changes</a><?= icon('chevron',15) ?></li></ul><div class="notice info" style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:12px;padding:11px 13px"><?= icon('info',16) ?><p>All metrics use live database records. No demo learner activity or invented growth statistics.</p></div></section></div>
